'''Kamukura''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS]] and [[RED BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|RED BUSTERS]] events. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update|Version 2.2]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.4 Update|Version 5.4]] increases health and range and decreases attack rate. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]].

